     <article class="story single" data-beat="education">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-10-23 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>byteXL's National Hackathon Attracts Over 4000 Participants from 40 Colleges Across 10 States</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#Hackathon</span> <span>#byteXL</span> <span>#Participants</span></div>
       <p>byteXL's National Hackathon has successfully concluded, drawing significant participation from students across India. The event saw over 4000 participants engaging from a diverse pool of academic institutions.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-23/bytexls-national-hackathon-attracts-over-4000-participants-f.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The hackathon's reach extended to 40 colleges across 10 different states, as reported by India Education Diary. A notable aspect of the participation was the strong representation from non-metro areas, with 78% of the participants hailing from Tier-2 and Tier-3 cities.</p><p>This broad engagement highlights byteXL's initiative in fostering talent development across various regions.</p><p>What to watch: Future editions of the hackathon and their regional impact.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft effectively captures the key metrics of the hackathon participation as provided in the summary.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
