     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-23 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Discrepancies Reported in Uttar Pradesh MLC Electoral Rolls</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Software errors led to unusual names and details appearing in the Allahabad-Jhansi graduates' constituency electoral roll ahead of the Uttar Pradesh Legislative Council elections. Voting for 11 seats, spanning five graduates' and six teachers' constituencies, concluded Friday with a 55.24% turnout.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-23/discrepancies-reported-in-uttar-pradesh-mlc-electoral-rolls.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The Samajwadi Party alleged that BJP supporters engaged in booth capturing and fraudulent voting, specifically citing incidents in Auraiya and Saharanpur. The BJP dismissed these claims as an attempt to excuse an expected electoral defeat. The Election Commission is currently investigating the reported irregularities and allegations of misconduct raised by opposition parties.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The summary accurately reflects the reported electoral irregularities and the SP/BJP political conflict.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/uttar-pradesh/unusual-names-details-crop-up-in-electoral-roll-for-mlc-polls-in-up-eci-cites-software-error/article71614964.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-23/discrepancies-reported-in-uttar-pradesh-mlc-electoral-rolls" data-title="Discrepancies Reported in Uttar Pradesh MLC Electoral Rolls"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
