     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-23 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Jodhpur Hit-and-Run Injures Two; Haryana Faces Power Crisis</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Two Rajasthan Judicial Service aspirants suffered leg fractures after a speeding, Bikaner-registered SUV struck their motorcycles in a Jodhpur hit-and-run. CCTV captured the incident, and police have launched a manhunt for the driver, while the victims remain in stable condition.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-23/jodhpur-hit-and-run-injures-two-haryana-faces-power-crisis.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Separately, a three-day strike by 40,000 electricity employees has caused widespread power and water outages across Haryana, including Gurugram and Faridabad. The unions are protesting the privatization of power distribution, leading to thousands of consumer complaints despite government leaders expressing solidarity with the staff.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Good coverage of the two distinct, unrelated news items provided in the source summary.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/video/speeding-suv-hits-motorcycle-in-jodhpur-two-injured-in-hit-and-run-incident-ytvd-3023259-2026-10-23?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/jodhpur/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jodhpur</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-23/jodhpur-hit-and-run-injures-two-haryana-faces-power-crisis" data-title="Jodhpur Hit-and-Run Injures Two; Haryana Faces Power Crisis"><b>Share:</b>
